1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,200
They stole about a hundred million in diamonds. Then a sandwich sank them.

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:08,820
Now back to Antwerp, Belgium, the diamond capital of the world.

3
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:13,600
Under its Diamond Centre sits a vault. Layer after layer of security, right?

4
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:17,460
Inside are safe-deposit boxes, locked drawers people rent.

5
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:21,520
Now meet Leonardo Notarbartolo, a man with a cover story.

6
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:25,000
He said he was a diamond dealer, and rented an office in the building.

7
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,740
Then he could come and go for a long time.

8
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,780
Hit like if you'd have trusted him too.

9
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:33,720
One weekend in February two thousand three, his crew hits the vault.

10
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:36,060
They break open box after box.

11
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:39,560
The haul? About a hundred million dollars, by estimates.

12
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:43,080
On a hundred grand a year, that's a thousand years of paychecks.

13
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:46,740
One job was left— the big one: burn the trash.

14
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:49,660
Send this to the friend who never takes out the trash.

15
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:53,200
It didn't happen. The bag got dumped by a road near Brussels.

16
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:57,220
Inside was evidence, including a half-eaten salami sandwich.

17
00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:00,680
Police say that sandwich carried Notarbartolo's DNA.

18
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:04,860
Five days later, he walked back into the Diamond Centre and got arrested.

19
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:08,400
Follow if you love a genius plan dying on one detail.

20
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:12,140
In two thousand five, an Antwerp court convicted him as the planner.

21
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:14,480
He was sentenced to ten years in prison.

22
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,720
Three of his crew got five years each.

23
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:19,240
And the diamonds? Most were never found.

24
00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:22,900
A hundred million dollars, and his trash tied him to it.

25
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:25,420
So, burn the bag or eat the sandwich?

